OL,3,AMan's body found in river sparks IOPC
OL,4,Ainquiry
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe death of a man who was being chased
OL,7,Fby police before he was found in the
OL,8,FRiver Lea, is being investigated by an
OL,9,Findependent watchdog.
OL,11,FEmergency services were called to the
OL,12,FHigh Street and towpath in Stanstead
OL,13,FAbbotts, Hertfordshire, on 14 September
OL,14,Fat about 13:20 BST.
OL,16,FOfficers said they pursued the man on
OL,17,Ffoot after identifying him as being
OL,18,Fwanted in connection with two
OL,19,Frobberies. He was no longer in their
OL,20,Fline of sight when he entered the
OL,21,Fwater.
OL,23,APub: 23-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
FL,310,300,200,140,0,100
